   713	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   714	# F-CHAOS-2/DevOps-P1-1: atomic install + rollback-on-failure
   715	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   716	# Strategy:
   717	#   - If $TARGET/.claude/ already exists, snapshot it to $BACKUP_DIR.
   718	#   - On ANY failure (trap EXIT rc != 0), remove the partial
   719	#     $TARGET/.claude/ and move the backup back into place.
   720	#   - On success, remove the backup in an explicit cleanup step.
